(104, 52, 'Bedrock Insurance Company Ltd', 'Insurance', 'Accra — Tafawa Balewa Street (per LinkedIn via Accra Street Journal profile)', 'Broken / unreachable — both domains the company itself prints on its adverts fail to load: bedrockinsurance.com.gh → 403 (curl and browser fetch, http and https); bedrockinsurancegh.com → 502 Bad Gateway (curl http and https). No working site reachable', 'Instagram @bedrockinsurancegh 1.2K followers, posting through Nov 2026; Facebook @bedrockInsuranceGH 380 followers, last post 18 Nov 2026', '030 296 2350 / 050 162 7648', 'info@bedrockinsurance.com.gh', 'Every advert and social post drives customers to a website that errors out (502 on the domain used in Nov 2026 posts, 403 on the other) — clicks from their own marketing hit a dead end ⚠ FLAG: Bedrock is a Groupe Nduom company — its own NIC licence is intact (on the 31 Oct 2026 register) and it is actively trading, but the parent group''s GN Bank licence saga gives the brand reputational baggage. Also: the 403 on bedrockinsurance.com.gh may be a bot/WAF block rather than a dead site — open bedrockinsurance.com.gh in a real browser before pitching; if it loads for a human, Bedrock drops to a stale-site rebuild at best. The 502 on bedrockinsurancegh.com (the domain in its Nov 2026 posts) is a genuine server failure.', 'Fix/rebuild on one canonical domain (other as redirect): product pages, online quote/buy, claims portal, contact', 8.5, 'Call 030 296 2350 or email info@bedrockinsurance.com.gh', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
