(1040, 144, 'Barari DV Ghana Ltd', 'Lithium mining (Ewoyaa Lithium Project).', 'Ewoyaa, Central Region (Mankessim area).', 'No Ghana-specific site. Only the Australian parent site atlanticlithium.com.au exists — parent-only presence, not a Ghana-facing site.', 'None found for the Ghana operation (not verified). Parent has corporate social channels.', 'No Ghana phone/email verified — do not invent. Parent: +61 2 8072 0640', 'IR@atlanticlithium.com.au', 'Ghana''s first-ever ratified lithium lease (Mar 2026) has no Ghana-facing web presence — no local project page, community info, jobs or supplier portal for a US$1.5bn-NPV project about to raise ~US$185m and hire ~900 construction workers.', 'Ghana project website — Ewoyaa project overview, timeline to FID/construction, community & local-content pages, jobs and supplier registration, newsroom for the ratification story.', 6.9, 'Via parent — IR@atlanticlithium.com.au / +61 2 8072 0640, asking for the Ghana (Ewoyaa) team.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
