(1046, 151, 'Fuzak Company Limited', 'Road, civil & building construction.', 'Tamale (ministry register: Box AN 1115, Tamale; a Go Africa Online listing also shows an Accra address — see flag).', 'No website found. Searched name + "website" and .com/.com.gh — no company domain surfaced anywhere.', 'No own Facebook/Instagram found. Strong third-party coverage: Kumasi Mail profile (~Aug 2026), Saboba road-progress video 5 Jul 2026, GNA Northern Excellence Awards (CEO won Community Builder & Social Impact Award, Jul 2025).', 'Not verified. Go Africa Online lists "Fuzak''s Company Limited, Fuzak Street, Abbey Street, Accra — +233 54 627 4181" — unverified match (name/address differ from the ministry''s Tamale record; do not treat as confirmed)', '', 'A1B1-classified contractor winning GH¢744.7m of work in one award round, with a high-profile CEO and major philanthropy, is invisible online — no portfolio, no credentials page, no way for a private/institutional client to verify or contact them except via the Ministry.', 'Corporate credibility site — project portfolio with contract values, A1B1 classification, Tamale base, CSR/philanthropy section, contact/quote form.', 6.7, 'Ministry of Roads & Highways / Ghana Highway Authority project channels, or the Go Africa Online phone above only after verifying it belongs to this firm.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1047, 152, 'Quintex Pharma Ltd', 'Generic pharmaceutical manufacturing (start-up).', 'Akuse (manufacturing base); Delaware holding company.', 'Stale/template rebuild — quintexpharma.com exists but is a thin template: contact page still shows fake placeholder "3575 Fake Buena Vista Avenue" and +1 (650) 555-0111; content is essentially press releases only.', 'None found under its own name.', '+233 (0)30 2789987 / +233 (0)24 414 1515 (EINPresswire, May 2025)', 'corp.affairs@quintexpharma.com', 'A company announcing major international JVs has a website with fake placeholder contact details — any partner/investor who tries to reach them hits a dead end.', 'Rebuild as a real corporate site — facility/technology story, JV news, product pipeline, working contact/careers.', 6.7, 'Email corp.affairs@quintexpharma.com.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
