(1051, 158, 'Salom Pharmaceuticals Ltd', 'Pharmaceutical manufacturing, marketing & distribution.', 'Kumasi (Asokore Mampong Industrial Area; HQ P.O. Box 4901, Adum) with Accra office.', 'No working website — salompharmacy.com (listed in a 2019 credit report) does not resolve (fetch failed, no DNS); no other domain found.', 'None found under its own name; award coverage Mar 2025.', '+233 322 094101 / +233 3220 94101 / +233 3221 9255; (job ad, 2025)', 'hr@salompharmaceuticals.com', 'An 80-staff manufacturer with 2018 sales of GH₵16.5m and a 2025 industry award is invisible online — no product catalogue, no distributor enquiry route.', 'Corporate + product catalogue site with distributor/wholesaler enquiry form and careers.', 6.6, 'Phone the Kumasi HQ number, then email HR address for an introduction.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
