(1055, 163, 'Golden Team Mining Company Ltd', 'Large-scale gold mining.', 'Accra (HQ, Osu) / Kenyasi, Ahafo Region (mine).', 'No website found (searched name + website; only trade data, Minerals Commission and Water Resources Commission registers, and GoldBod deal coverage surfaced).', 'None found (not verified).', 'None verified — no phone, email or social found. Address (from trade data): 4114B Koi Street, Osu, Accra', '', 'A large-scale gold producer in a national GoldBod deal is invisible online — no site, no contact channel, no public profile beyond government registers.', 'Corporate website — company profile, Kenyasi operations, GoldBod partnership, community/ESG, careers and a contact page (the single biggest gap is simply being reachable).', 6.4, 'In person at 4114B Koi Street, Osu, Accra; or via GoldBod / Minerals Commission channels. Do not cold-call — no number verified.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1056, 164, 'Paloma Hotel', 'Hotel / serviced apartments.', 'Accra (Ring Road Central + Spintex).', 'Site loads (palomahotel.com) but homepage copy is garbled/nonsensical ("On the present site of our hotel feet in the water, there used to be an establishment composed of a restaurant and dormitories…") — effectively broken content; no clear online booking.', 'Facebook 32K followers (@PalomaHotelGhana), active Sep 2026; Instagram @palomahotelgh.', '024 433 6070 / 054 431 3113; email not verified', '', 'A 25-year-old, two-branch hotel''s own website reads like machine-translated filler, so guests are pushed to phone/Facebook for prices (commenters repeatedly ask for rates and are just told to visit the site).', 'Content-and-design rebuild: real rooms/rates, online booking, events/weddings pages, both branches.', 6.4, 'Call 024 433 6070.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1057, 165, 'Amarlogix Ghana Limited', 'Freight forwarding / customs clearing / warehousing.', 'Accra — Spintex Road (18 Junction, Block Factory) + Oyibi.', 'BROKEN/DEAD — amarlogixgh.com (listed by CuteStat) and amarlogix.com both failed to resolve/load in a curl test this session (000/FAIL); BusinessGhana lists no website. The email info@amarlogix.com uses the same dead domain, so email deliverability is doubtful.', 'Facebook — Amarlogix GHANA Limited, 510 followers, post 7 Oct 2026 (flyer: "Smart Logistics. Seamless Delivery."); Instagram @amarlogixghanalimited, 140 followers, posts Aug–Sep 2026.', '0555 707 768 / 0500 550 911 (also 0599 308 032 on IG flyer); (unverified — domain dead, see above)', 'info@amarlogix.com', 'No working website at all, and even its published email domain does not resolve; all enquiries must go through Facebook/Instagram DMs or phone, while it sells to corporate clients (oil & gas, mining, manufacturing, retail, cars).', 'Full corporate site — services (air/sea/land, customs, warehousing, door-to-door), industries served, quote form, WhatsApp click-to-chat, working business email on the new domain.', 6.4, 'Phone/WhatsApp 0555 707 768 first (email may bounce); Facebook DM as backup.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1058, 166, 'Bilal Mining Services Ltd', 'Contract mining & heavy equipment rental.', 'Takoradi (HQ); sites at Damang and Chirano, Western Region.', 'No website found.', 'None found (not verified).', 'None verified — no phone, email or social found', '', 'A 500+ employee contract miner working for major gold mines has no web presence at all — invisible to mine operators tendering work under the Jan 2025 local-content rules (surface work to Ghanaian contractors by 31 Dec 2026).', 'Corporate website — services (contract mining, equipment rental), fleet, safety record, client/mine-site experience, careers and tender contact. Strong local-content pitch: the 2026 deadline is creating demand for visible Ghanaian contractors.', 6.4, 'In person at Takoradi HQ; or via Minerals Commission support-service register (MC-972). No phone/email verified.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1059, 167, 'Chriswed Limited (also spelled "Christwed Ltd" in ministry records)', 'Road & building construction.', 'Not verified — works in Volta/Oti Regions (Hohoe–Baika–Jasikan); HQ not found.', 'No website found.', 'No own accounts found. Third-party only: MP Fred Agbenyo''s Facebook site-visit post 12 Jun 2026 (450 likes, 140 comments) praising the Hohoe–Lolobi–Jasikan work.', 'Not verified', '', 'GH¢538.7m contract holder with an MP publicly praising its work has zero online presence — no way for anyone outside the constituency to find, vet or hire them.', 'Corporate site — the 61.47 km Hohoe–Baika–Jasikan project as flagship case study, services, contact form.', 6.4, 'Via Ministry of Roads & Highways or the Hohoe/Jasikan constituency office; no direct contact verified.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1060, 168, 'MM Delovely Company Limited', 'Road & civil construction.', 'Not verified — projects in Central Region (Kasoa–Winneba) and Ahafo (Bediako–Camp 15–Sefwi Adabokrom).', 'No website found.', 'No own accounts found. Third-party only: presidential inspection coverage (2026), parliamentary committee inspection 2024, Facebook site video 31 Oct 2026.', 'Not verified. Project Manager named in 2024 press as Ing. Stephen Tawiah (no contact given)', '', 'One of Ghana''s largest indigenous road contractors — Kasoa–Winneba dualisation lots worth tens of millions of US dollars plus GH¢785m + GH¢273m in 2025 awards — has no website at all, despite presidential praise for its work.', 'Corporate site — Kasoa–Winneba as flagship, project list, equipment/fleet, contact form.', 6.3, 'Via Ministry of Roads & Highways / Ghana Highway Authority.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1061, 169, 'Nextedeg Construction', 'Construction.', 'Adenta, Accra.', 'HAS a website: nextedeg-bold-build.lovable.app (Adenta office, GD-006, A16, 5908 Awuku Ave; +233 24 962 7687; info@nextedeg.com; active Facebook Nov 2026). At most a rebuild/upgrade pitch for a Lovable template site.', 'Facebook active Nov 2026; June 2026 post drew 15K likes / 1,100 comments.', '+233 249 627 687 / ( unverified)', 'nextedegconstruction@gmail.com', 'A firm with a Lovable template site and no own-domain website — no professional portfolio or enquiry funnel.', 'Rebuild/upgrade to a proper own-domain site.', 6.3, 'Phone +233 249 627 687.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1062, 170, 'Noble House Hotel', 'Hotel.', 'Kumasi.', 'No website found anywhere — BusinessGhana website field blank; only OTA listings (TripAdvisor, Tiket.com, etc.).', 'Weak — no own Facebook page found; TikTok property tour 15 Aug 2026.', '+233 32 203 5091 (BusinessGhana) / +233 277 779 786 (PilotPlans); email not verified', '', 'No direct online presence at all — an established hotel with a restaurant, gym and meeting rooms is bookable only through third-party sites that take commission.', 'Full new website: rooms, award-winning Indian & Chinese restaurant, gym, meeting rooms, airport shuttle, direct booking.', 6.3, 'Call +233 32 203 5091.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1063, 171, 'Shenashe Limited', 'Road construction.', 'Not verified — project area North Tongu, Volta Region (Mepe–Sege); HQ not found.', 'No website found.', 'No own accounts found. Third-party only: GNA/Citi Newsroom coverage Feb 2026, Jonilar.net Instagram launch post 1 Feb 2026.', 'Not verified', '', 'First-class 31.2 km road contractor (GH¢627.5m) announced by an MP in national press, yet has no website, no contact point and no project page — all enquiries must go through politicians or the Ministry.', 'Corporate site — Sege–Mepe flagship project page, company profile, contact/quote form.', 6.3, 'Via Ministry of Roads & Highways / North Tongu MP''s office; no direct contact verified.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1064, 172, 'True Vine Hospital', 'Private hospital.', 'Kumasi (Pankrono Estate; P.O. Box KS 4405, Adum).', 'No website. GhanaHospitals website field is blank; no domain found in any directory; Waze wrongly links a hotel domain (truevinehotelgh.com).', 'None found.', '032 207 1802 / 054 999 2333 / 020 708 1531. Email not verified', '', 'A 15-year-old 24-hour hospital with NHIS + private-insurer accreditation is invisible online beyond directory stubs.', 'Full hospital website — services, specialists, insurance list, 24h emergency, booking.', 6.3, 'Phone.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
