(1067, 175, 'Value Properties Gh', 'Property consultancy / surveyors / real estate.', 'Obuasi (office also in Kumasi).', 'BROKEN/UNVERIFIED — RocketReach lists http://www.valuepropertiesgh.com, but browser.open 22 Nov 2026 failed to resolve; GhanaWebSolutions Obuasi directory says "No Website Link".', 'None found.', '+233 24 446 3501; GhanaYello lists +233 32 254 1179. Email not verified. Address: Ceci Hotel Bldg., Golf Course Rd., Obuasi', '', 'A 1997-established firm with corporate/bank clients and no working website — no online credibility or enquiry channel for a consultancy that lives on trust.', 'Professional corporate site — services (valuations, agency, management), corporate client proof, team/credentials, contact/enquiry form.', 6.3, 'Phone +233 24 446 3501.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
