(1148, 259, 'AECI Mining Explosives Ghana', 'Explosives manufacturing & drilling/blasting services.', 'Accra (HQ) / Tarkwa (site operations, incl. AngloGold Iduapriem).', 'No Ghana-specific site. Only the parent site aeciworld.com — parent-only presence.', 'Facebook activity Oct 2026 (AECI Ghana "Brilliant But Needy" scholarship flyer, posted 2 Oct 2026).', '(verified in job listings). Scholarship enquiries 0540113448 (per Oct 2026 Facebook flyer). No general Ghana phone verified', 'Ghana.Recruitment@aeciworld.com', 'A global explosives major operating at Tarkwa and Iduapriem has no Ghana web presence — recruitment, scholarships and site work are all announced through job boards and Facebook flyers instead of an owned channel.', 'Ghana pages/site — services (drilling & blasting, emulsion), site operations, safety, scholarships/CSR, careers portal.', 5.0, 'Email Ghana.Recruitment@aeciworld.com.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1149, 260, 'Adamus Resources Ltd', 'Gold mining (Nzema Gold Mine, operating).', 'Nkroful/Esiama, Ellembelle District, Western Region (mine); Accra (Airport Residential Area office).', 'No standalone Ghana site. Old site adamusresources.com.au is dead/historical; parent Nguvu Mining site (nguvumining.com) has an Adamus page — parent-only presence.', 'None found for Adamus itself (not verified).', 'None verified — no phone/email found. Addresses: mine — Nkroful/Esiama, P.O. Box ES 31, Esiama; Accra office — 35 Nortei Ababio Street, Airport Residential Area, P.O. Box KAPMB 93, Airport, Accra', '', 'A commercial gold producer with ~500–1,000 employees has no Ghana-facing site — its only web footprint is a parent-company page and a dead legacy domain.', 'Corporate Ghana website — Nzema mine, operations & safety, community, careers, contact. (Only pitch after the trust flag below is checked.)', 5.0, 'In person at the Accra office (35 Nortei Ababio Street) or mine site; or via Nguvu Mining. No phone/email verified.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
