(1182, 293, 'Bantam Logistics and Commodities Ltd', 'Freight forwarding / clearing + commodities trading (cashew, maize, shea, timber).', 'Tema — Community 5.', 'WORKING BUT THIN/STALE — bantam-logistics.com.gh loads (checked live this session) but is a bare Mobirise template: home page only in the fetch, © 2022, and the footer phone is placeholder "+1-234-567-8901". Scored low as a rebuild only.', 'Facebook — facebook.com/bantamlogistics (follower count not verified).', '+233 208 555 831; email not verified; Director Paul Austin-Fynn', '', 'Site exists but is a 2022 template with a fake US phone number in the footer — a corporate importer checking it would not trust it; no quote, tracking or commodities catalogue.', 'Rebuild — real phone/address, services + commodities lines, quote/WhatsApp, CLN network credibility.', 4.1, 'Phone/WhatsApp +233 208 555 831; Facebook DM.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1183, 294, 'St. Kathryn''s Hospital & Fertility Centre', 'Private hospital + fertility centre.', 'North Kaneshie, Accra (13 Amar Koranteng St, behind The Qodesh).', 'Stale rebuild — site loads but is an unfinished template: stkathrynshospital.com (verified live 22 Nov 2026) is a July 2022 WordPress template with Lorem Ipsum blog posts and fake testimonials ("Kevin Bacon", "Adam Scott, General Manager", "Thomas Hardy").', 'Facebook 67 followers; Instagram @st_kathryns 280 followers; active 13 Nov 2026 (World Kindness Day post).', '030 223 5710 / 050 140 0685; WhatsApp 050 635 7935. Email not verified (a directory lists — shared with Lighthouse Mission Hospital, suggesting a group link; not verified as theirs)', 'lighthousemissionhospitalfc@gmail.com', 'The live site actively damages trust — fake foreign testimonials and placeholder text on a real hospital''s domain.', 'Proper rebuild with real staff, services, fertility centre and booking; delete all placeholder/fake content.', 4.1, 'Phone / WhatsApp.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1184, 295, 'Plan Cargo Ghana Limited', 'Freight forwarding / customs clearance / haulage / project logistics.', 'Takoradi — Harbour Road, opposite Harbour Post Office, 4th Floor West Port Building, P.O. Box TD 944.', 'LISTED, LIVE STATUS UNVERIFIED — MarineTraffic lists www.plancargo.com; a browser fetch this session returned HTTP 403 (access denied), which does not prove the site is dead (likely bot-blocking). Do not claim broken; re-check before pitching.', 'Facebook — facebook.com/plancargo and "Plan_Cargo_Ghana_Limited" (follower counts not verified).', '+233 555 553 488; email not verified', '', 'Takoradi port operator with no verifiable working website from a researcher''s standpoint — if the site is in fact dead/blocked, importers cannot reach it online; if it works, it is at best a stale rebuild.', 'New site (or rebuild) — Takoradi port services, customs/haulage/project logistics, quote form, WhatsApp.', 4.1, 'Phone/WhatsApp +233 555 553 488; Facebook DM.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1185, 296, 'GN Reinsurance Co. Ltd (GN Re)', 'Reinsurance.', 'Accra (Airport Residential Area).', 'Site gnreinsurance.com LOADS but is a buggy template: lorem-ipsum placeholder text on the homepage, a "Contact form not found" error, and social icons linking to the theme developer (Qode) instead of the company. Verified by direct fetch 22 Nov 2026.', 'None of its own found (only the template''s developer links).', '+233 30 254 2413; email masked in the fetch — an AIO brochure lists (reported, not verified on their own site). Address: No. 40, Sir Arku Korsah Rd, Airport Residential Area, Accra. Reinsurance Company of the Year 2024', 'info@gnreinsurance.com', 'A reinsurer of the year whose own site shows placeholder text and a broken contact form — it undermines credibility with insurer clients.', 'Clean rebuild on a proper theme: real copy, working contact form, partner/testimonial pages, LinkedIn presence.', 4.0, 'Phone 030 254 2413.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1186, 297, 'Ghana Christian University College', 'Private university college.', 'Dodowa.', 'Site ghanacu.edu.gh loads BUT broken template (calls the institution "Prestige University", generic US copy).', 'Not verified.', '0303 252 042', '', 'A 1966-founded college whose live site calls it "Prestige University" with generic US copy.', 'Rebuild with real identity, programmes, admissions. ONLY after the trust flag is cleared.', 4.0, 'Phone 0303 252 042.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1187, 298, 'Logistics Connect', 'Freight forwarding / project logistics / energy logistics.', 'Tema — 2nd Floor, Bits N Pieces Building, Community 1 (also TDC Towers listing).', 'WORKING BUT STALE — logisticsconnectgh.com loads (checked live this session); last crawl Sep 2024, no evident recent updates, no quote/tracking visible. BusinessGhana lists no website for it. Scored low as a rebuild only.', 'None found.', '0200 795 137 / 0248 182 400; email not verified', '', 'A high-end project-logistics firm (oil & gas majors as clients) has a dated brochure site with no online quote, tracking or current project updates — it does not reflect the scale of work it actually does.', 'Rebuild — project portfolio, client logos/testimonials, quote + tracking, energy/project cargo pages.', 4.0, 'Phone 0200 795 137.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1188, 299, 'Central College of Science and Technology (CCST)', 'Private tertiary college (health sciences + TVET).', 'Agona Swedru, Central Region.', 'Working but stale/template site (centralcollegegh.com, fetched 22 Nov 2026, crawled 2026-11-05): every programme description is the same copied text ("The Nursing programme prepare students to provide high quality…" — even under Electrical Installation and Garment Making); news section is junk (empty dashes + 2023 ResearchGate dumps); no contact details visible; no fees. Admissions run via subdomain admissions.centralcollegegh.com (per Facebook flyers 2026-08-31).', 'Facebook "Central College of Science and Technology -CCST", 20 followers; Sep 2026 admissions flyers.', 'Not verified — flyer numbers not readable in search summaries', '', 'The site actively misleads: identical boilerplate under every programme, no contact details, no fees — a prospective student cannot tell programmes apart or reach the college.', 'Full rebuild with real per-programme copy, fees, contact, online application (keep the admissions subdomain).', 3.9, 'Facebook page message; admissions.centralcollegegh.com.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1189, 300, 'AB Solar Africa (now AB Solar International)', 'Solar EPC + finance (C&I).', 'Tema (Ashfoam building, Adjei-Kojo).', 'Stale/thin — absolar-africa.com home page last updated 565 days before 22 Nov 2026; other pages are PDFs from 2018–2020. Company has renamed to AB Solar International (subsidiary of Evolution C&I, Mauritius) but the site still carries the old name.', 'None found.', '+233 244808847', 'info@absolar-africa.com', 'A C&I EPC firm with blue-chip references (Cargill 565 kWp, Labianca 385 kWp) presents itself through a 2018-era site under a superseded name.', 'Rebrand/rebuild under AB Solar International: reference projects, finance offering, multi-country footprint.', 3.8, 'Email info@absolar-africa.com.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL)
