(1191, 302, 'G and Y Boresa Ltd', 'Licensed Customs House Agency / freight forwarding (air & sea).', 'Ashaiman — Adjei Kojo Santeo Road, Accra.', 'WORKING BUT STALE — gandyboresagh.com loads; site last updated ~767 days ago, News page ~1,730 days ago, latest blog Feb 2024. Scored low as a rebuild only.', 'None found.', '0591 590 892', 'info@gandyboresagh.com', 'Licensed customs house agent since 2013 whose site has not been updated since ~2024 — no current news, no quote/tracking, so it reads as dormant to a new importer.', 'Rebuild/refresh — current services, quote form, customs guidance content, WhatsApp.', 3.8, 'Phone/WhatsApp 0591 590 892 or info@gandyboresagh.com.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1192, 303, 'Iskus Power Ltd', 'Power systems — UPS, AVR, generators, solar inverters/panels.', 'Accra (Kaneshie, P.O. Box KN 5131).', 'Live but dated — iskuspower.com loads (crawled 3 days ago) but the content is basic and typo-ridden ("geneators aer"), with no evident fresh content.', 'None found.', '+233 302265059 / +233 302778806 / +233 202077784; email not verified', '', 'A 2002-founded firm serving banks (UMB, Stanbic, UBA testimonials) presents itself through an amateur-looking site with typos — a trust problem for corporate buyers.', 'Professional rebuild: corporate client proof, product catalogue, service/maintenance pages.', 3.6, 'Phone +233 302265059.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
