(1195, 306, 'Takoradi Renewable Power Resources Ltd', 'Solar + wind turbine installation, maintenance and management.', 'Takoradi (3 New Age St, West Anaji).', 'UNVERIFIED — takoradirenewablepower.com is cited in old directories (GhanaYello last update 2018) but no crawl content of the site surfaced, and one fetch attempt failed with a local worker error (not proof the site is dead). Live-browser check required.', 'None found.', '031-2297424 (from old directories); email not verified', '', 'If the site is dead, a Takoradi renewables firm has no web presence at all; if it is live, this lead should be dropped.', 'Verify site first; if dead, build a fresh installer site.', 3.4, 'Phone 031-2297424 (old listing — verify it still works).', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
