(1198, 309, 'AROD Insurance Brokers Ltd', 'Insurance broking (life & general, retail & corporate).', 'Tema / Accra.', 'THIN working site — arodbrokers.com loads but is JS-gated ("Please enable JS") with very thin text content and no contact details or quote form visible in the extracted text. Checked 22 Nov 2026.', 'None verified (only masked forms seen).', 'IBAG 050 200 0088; also 030 800 9526 via a GAA group-enrolment memo naming Ms. Bernice LeMaire. Email not verified — do not invent (only masked forms were seen). Managing Director: Edmund Amankwa-Sakyi', 'contact@arodbrokers.com', 'The site is effectively a blank page to most visitors and crawlers — no services, no contact details, no quote route.', 'Full rebuild with services, team, quote request and contact details.', 3.1, 'Phone 050 200 0088.', 'new', NULL, NULL, NULL),
